<p>Cold Flames slowly spread from <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> spots in a radius of 3 around the targeted location. The flames deal <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">53, 71, 85, 97, 108</acronym> cold damage, and have a chance of freezing.</p><p>Damage improves with your Spellpower.</p>